00:12:42.620 --> 00:12:44.080
Me, too!

00:12:44.410 --> 00:12:45.790
Sure, go for it.

00:12:45.790 --> 00:12:48.700
Whoa. They're exactly what I thought
horns would feel like!

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:51.950
They're so stylish. Totally fitting for a Demon Girl.

00:12:51.950 --> 00:12:54.250
They've got a nice feel to them.

00:12:52.500 --> 00:12:54.250
This may seem strange to say,

00:12:54.250 --> 00:12:56.250
but I'm surprised you're both taking this in stride.

00:12:56.250 --> 00:12:58.290
Well, there's a lot of weirdos in this town.

00:12:57.200 --> 00:12:58.330
SMOOTH

00:13:01.330 --> 00:13:02.120
"Weird"...

00:13:02.120 --> 00:13:03.290
Oh! I didn't mean you!

00:13:03.290 --> 00:13:06.080
Don't try and hide them, they really suit you!

00:13:06.080 --> 00:13:08.160
They're super cool, they look like giant croissants!

00:13:08.200 --> 00:13:11.250
Croissant
Crescent shaped bread is really yummy.

00:13:08.950 --> 00:13:10.120
Croissant...

00:13:11.290 --> 00:13:13.950
Right now, I need to focus on finding a Magical Girl!

00:13:14.330 --> 00:13:17.290
I have to offer their blood
to this Demon God Statue of my ancestors!

00:13:17.450 --> 00:13:19.410
Uh, isn't your ancestor a little broken there? On the top.

00:13:19.540 --> 00:13:22.950
Fortunately, I know there's one in this town.
I will hunt down that Magical Girl!

00:13:19.700 --> 00:13:20.700
Fwip

00:13:22.950 --> 00:13:26.580
Oh yeah, there's a Magical Girl
in our school. Class A, right?

00:13:26.580 --> 00:13:29.200
Ah, the super strong one.

00:13:29.540 --> 00:13:31.410
Oh? Is that so?

00:13:32.950 --> 00:13:35.250
Wait! What the heck is up with this school?!

00:13:35.290 --> 00:13:40.330
Sakuragaoka High School

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:38.000
This is Sakuragaoka High School.

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:40.290
Yuko and her friends are students here.

00:13:43.120 --> 00:13:44.580
That's Momo Chiyoda.

00:13:44.750 --> 00:13:46.540
We went to the same middle school.

00:13:47.580 --> 00:13:48.580
I see you over there!

00:13:48.580 --> 00:13:50.080
Oh no, you spotted me!

00:13:50.080 --> 00:13:51.160
I can't see anything now.

00:13:51.620 --> 00:13:54.160
Huh? That razor-sharp look...

00:13:54.160 --> 00:13:55.620
I've seen it somewhere before.

00:13:59.200 --> 00:14:00.040
Ahh!

00:14:00.040 --> 00:14:02.910
It's that girl who stopped the trunk
with one hand the other day!

00:14:02.910 --> 00:14:03.750
You know her?

00:14:04.290 --> 00:14:07.040
Dealing with her was aggravating in more ways than one.

00:14:05.000 --> 00:14:06.290
Outrage...!

00:14:05.660 --> 00:14:12.450
Tuna & Onion
Danish

00:14:07.120 --> 00:14:10.660
I heard that six years ago,
she actually saved the whole world.

00:14:10.660 --> 00:14:12.160
She's known worldwide?!

00:14:12.950 --> 00:14:16.450
I... I never would have guessed
I was tangling with someone that amazing.

00:14:16.700 --> 00:14:21.830
I wonder if a lowly neighborhood demon like myself
stands a chance against a world-renowned magician.

00:14:22.040 --> 00:14:23.660
Does this string phone work?

00:14:24.120 --> 00:14:25.580
I can hear you.

00:14:25.700 --> 00:14:28.370
I wonder if there's any other information
I can find about her.

00:14:28.370 --> 00:14:31.250
Hm, she doesn't really talk about herself much.

00:14:31.410 --> 00:14:34.120
Oh, that's right. One time during our fitness exams...

00:14:34.830 --> 00:14:38.950
Excuse me. I can't get an accurate reading
on grip strength because I maxed out the dynamometer.

00:14:39.160 --> 00:14:41.580
Everyone kind of flipped out when she said that.

00:14:41.790 --> 00:14:44.700
In the end, they had to use three dynamometers
together to get an accurate reading.

00:14:45.290 --> 00:14:49.660
Is she really a "Magical" Girl?
Are we sure she's not just a "Tangible" Girl?

00:14:49.660 --> 00:14:52.620
Then on the lung capacity test,
she totally maxed out the counter.

00:14:52.620 --> 00:14:54.290
Is that something that even has a maximum?!

00:14:54.290 --> 00:14:55.700
It made a really cool sound.

00:14:56.790 --> 00:14:58.410
Grr...

00:14:56.830 --> 00:14:59.790
GRR...

00:14:59.790 --> 00:15:05.750
Meanwhile, I have to rest at least once when carrying
even a small bag of rice home from the store!

00:15:05.750 --> 00:15:08.450
I think you could be a bit more athletic than that.

00:15:08.450 --> 00:15:11.080
Well then... I guess I'll go show her who's boss!

00:15:11.450 --> 00:15:14.040
I forget, is grip strength proportional to punch strength?

00:15:14.040 --> 00:15:19.250
FREEZE

00:15:15.330 --> 00:15:18.250
Recess will end in 3 minutes.

00:15:19.450 --> 00:15:23.000
Recess is about to end, so we should
probably head back to the classroom.

00:15:23.000 --> 00:15:26.120
You've got 3 whole minutes,
that's plenty of time to pick a fight!

00:15:23.330 --> 00:15:23.750
FWIP

00:15:26.120 --> 00:15:27.450
Get out there, girl!

00:15:27.870 --> 00:15:29.950
I have to find a place to hide and launch a sneak attack.

00:15:29.950 --> 00:15:34.370
Hey Chiyoda! Yoshida from Class D is a descendent
of the Dark Clan and has something for you!

00:15:34.370 --> 00:15:35.750
You backstabber!

00:15:37.790 --> 00:15:40.080
Oh crap, she's coming. She's coming!

00:15:45.870 --> 00:15:46.750
What?

00:15:48.370 --> 00:15:51.290
Sh-she's huge! A whole head taller than me!

00:15:51.290 --> 00:15:53.500
Come on, Yuko. Give it to her straight!

00:15:53.500 --> 00:15:55.500
Oh, you're that little girl from yesterday.

00:15:55.500 --> 00:15:57.620
Gah! "Little girl"?!

00:15:57.620 --> 00:16:11.160
Growl... snarl!

00:15:59.950 --> 00:16:03.540
Whoza callin little! Punkimma grow way tallrthen u!

00:16:03.540 --> 00:16:06.450
Yuko! Your brain and your mouth
can't keep up with each other!

00:16:06.450 --> 00:16:11.160
Who're you callin' little?! Don't get cocky, you punk!
I'm still young enough to grow way taller than you!"

00:16:11.160 --> 00:16:12.290
That's what you meant to say!

00:16:12.290 --> 00:16:13.870
Yeah, what she said!

00:16:14.000 --> 00:16:19.080
Sorry, I didn't mean to offend you.
I just objectively thought you were on the short side.

00:16:19.080 --> 00:16:23.000
Outrage! Outrage! Outrage...!

00:16:19.080 --> 00:16:23.000
That doesn't change anything!
If she's trying to pick a fight, then she's got one!

00:16:19.290 --> 00:16:23.120
Outrage!!
Outrage!!

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:24.080
I am Shami...

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:24.660
Uh-huh.

00:16:24.660 --> 00:16:26.200
Shadow Mistress Yuko!

00:16:26.200 --> 00:16:26.950
Uh-huh.

00:16:26.950 --> 00:16:31.330
To restore my ancestors to their former glory
and to conkeer... ahem, conquer the world of darkness...

00:16:31.870 --> 00:16:32.540
Inhale

00:16:34.080 --> 00:16:36.580
...I've come to end the life of a Magical Girl!

00:16:36.870 --> 00:16:37.580
Uh-huh.

00:16:37.950 --> 00:16:39.250
Huff...

00:16:40.830 --> 00:16:41.450
Out of Ammo

00:16:41.450 --> 00:16:42.790
...and that's the deal.

00:16:42.790 --> 00:16:43.750
I see.

00:16:43.750 --> 00:16:45.410
You flubbed up twice, huh?

00:16:45.410 --> 00:16:48.330
Because you kept interrupting
and throwing me off my pace!

00:16:48.330 --> 00:16:49.290
Want to try again?

00:16:50.200 --> 00:16:51.700
No interruptions this time, okay?

00:16:52.080 --> 00:16:54.620
Okay, give it one more shot. "Shamiko," was it?

00:16:54.620 --> 00:16:59.500
No! I am Yuko Yoshida, also known as Shami...
Shadow Mistress Yuko!

00:16:54.620 --> 00:16:56.450
Outrage!!

00:16:56.620 --> 00:16:57.160
Outrage!!

00:16:57.330 --> 00:16:58.000
Outrage!!

00:16:58.160 --> 00:16:58.700
Outrage!!

00:16:58.870 --> 00:16:59.450
Outrage!!

00:16:59.500 --> 00:17:01.250
Snicker

00:16:59.500 --> 00:17:01.290
So, you are "Sha-mi-ko" then.

00:17:01.290 --> 00:17:02.540
Don't laugh!

00:17:02.540 --> 00:17:04.660
Don't worry about sounding cool, Shami!

00:17:02.660 --> 00:17:03.000
Thumbs up!!

00:17:04.660 --> 00:17:06.410
Stop helping that nickname catch on!

00:17:06.410 --> 00:17:07.330
No big deal!

00:17:07.750 --> 00:17:08.620
Shamirin?

00:17:08.620 --> 00:17:09.830
Huh?! What did you say?

00:17:08.660 --> 00:17:09.370
UGH

00:17:09.830 --> 00:17:10.540
Nothing.

00:17:10.540 --> 00:17:16.120
UWAA! PREPAAAAREEE YOURSEEEEEEEELLLLF!

00:17:16.120 --> 00:17:17.080
Get her!

00:17:16.200 --> 00:17:17.200
Go!
Go!

00:17:17.080 --> 00:17:22.450
Take this, and that, and this, and that...!

00:17:17.200 --> 00:17:22.540
BONK      BONK      BONK      BONK      BONK      BONK

00:17:22.830 --> 00:17:26.750
B... BONK... BONK...

00:17:27.000 --> 00:17:28.910
BO...

00:17:33.700 --> 00:17:39.080
Sigh...

00:17:33.750 --> 00:17:37.160
M-my sides hurt... and my wrists, too...

00:17:37.410 --> 00:17:38.950
She's a bigger wimp than I thought.

00:17:39.580 --> 00:17:40.700
Are you okay?

00:17:40.910 --> 00:17:44.580
A Demon Girl is attacking you
and yet you won't even transform...

00:17:45.040 --> 00:17:47.620
Why didn't you try to dodge at the very least?!

00:17:47.620 --> 00:17:49.790
Because I didn't deem it necessary to avoid your attacks.

00:17:50.160 --> 00:17:52.950
That's right. I forgot this girl
stopped a truck with one hand.

00:17:53.330 --> 00:17:56.290
I never thought my first battle would go so poorly.

00:17:58.370 --> 00:18:01.160
I should have eaten more to give myself extra energy.

00:18:01.370 --> 00:18:02.950
Is that really the problem here?

00:18:03.330 --> 00:18:04.790
If you want a pastry, I've got one.

00:18:04.790 --> 00:18:05.750
A pastry?!

00:18:06.200 --> 00:18:08.870
If you take any more pity on me,
I think I might cry, so just stop!

00:18:09.080 --> 00:18:10.450
I see some tears already, no?

00:18:10.450 --> 00:18:12.620
No, I stopped them before any could actually come out.

00:18:12.910 --> 00:18:13.790
Oh really?

00:18:13.790 --> 00:18:15.000
Do you have a minute?

00:18:15.000 --> 00:18:15.790
Huh?

00:18:16.000 --> 00:18:16.830
Can you stand?

00:18:16.830 --> 00:18:17.700
Huh?

00:18:19.370 --> 00:18:22.580
SHAMIKO'S PERSPECTIVE

00:18:19.410 --> 00:18:20.540
Come on, get up.

00:18:20.540 --> 00:18:21.370
...Come on, get up...

00:18:21.370 --> 00:18:22.200
...Come on, get up...

00:18:22.580 --> 00:18:24.370
EEEEEEK!
SHAMIKO'S PERSPECTIVE

00:18:22.700 --> 00:18:24.160
Eek!

00:18:28.540 --> 00:18:29.500
What are you...?

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:32.370
Don't tell me, she's going to throw me with all her might?

00:18:32.450 --> 00:18:40.120
IMAGINATION
Nooooo!

00:18:32.540 --> 00:18:35.120
Demon Eradication Attack!

00:18:35.120 --> 00:18:36.040
Nooo!

00:18:36.200 --> 00:18:39.200
I'm doomed, I should have accepted
that pastry when I had the chance!

00:18:40.290 --> 00:18:41.120
I...

00:18:43.620 --> 00:18:45.620
I'm bewwy sowwy!

00:18:45.620 --> 00:18:47.000
She's emotionally weak, too!

00:18:47.040 --> 00:18:50.040
S
H
A
K
E
SHIVER

00:18:47.950 --> 00:18:49.790
The way you throw punches needs some work.

00:18:49.790 --> 00:18:50.660
Bwuh?

00:18:50.660 --> 00:18:52.870
Unless you put your thumb here like this, you'll get hurt.

00:18:52.870 --> 00:18:56.500
Don't just use your arm,
you have to swing your whole body like this.

00:18:56.790 --> 00:18:58.370
SWISH

00:18:57.120 --> 00:18:59.450
This is an odd sight for a school hallway.

00:18:58.370 --> 00:18:59.450
SWISH
SWISH

00:18:59.540 --> 00:19:02.370
You should aim for the chin or the stomach. Give it a try.

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:03.370
Huh? What?

00:19:03.540 --> 00:19:04.750
Just give it a try.

00:19:03.700 --> 00:19:05.410
BRING
IT
ON

00:19:04.750 --> 00:19:05.290
Okay.

00:19:07.910 --> 00:19:11.370
POOOOOOOW!

00:19:11.540 --> 00:19:12.790
It made a different sound this time.

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:15.200
Waaaaaah
Waaaah

00:19:13.200 --> 00:19:15.080
It sounded a lot stronger than before!

00:19:16.410 --> 00:19:18.120
Your style...

00:19:19.000 --> 00:19:21.160
...or form, rather...

00:19:23.120 --> 00:19:24.580
Well...

00:19:25.790 --> 00:19:26.910
Uh....

00:19:29.290 --> 00:19:30.250
Yeah...

00:19:31.500 --> 00:19:33.200
Sigh

00:19:31.500 --> 00:19:33.580
You might want to consider using projectiles instead.

00:19:34.660 --> 00:19:35.580
Sigh

00:19:37.410 --> 00:19:39.290
D-d-d...

00:19:40.410 --> 00:19:43.120
Don't think this means you've won!

00:19:40.410 --> 00:19:41.000
Waaaaaah

00:19:45.000 --> 00:19:47.120
That's that. See you later, Chiyoda.

00:19:47.120 --> 00:19:48.290
Uh, sure.

00:19:48.290 --> 00:19:50.370
Don't give up, Yuko!

00:19:48.290 --> 00:19:50.660
Waaaaaaaah

00:19:50.370 --> 00:19:54.250
Train your entire body until you're strong enough
to become a great demon!

00:19:50.660 --> 00:19:57.410
Sniffle     Sniffle

00:19:54.250 --> 00:19:57.290
Sniffle, sniffle... Sniffle, sniffle...

00:20:11.410 --> 00:20:13.870
JAGATARA CHIPS
TUNA, SEA URCHIN,
& FISH EGG FLAVOR

00:20:20.330 --> 00:20:21.790
Yeah, these are good.

00:20:22.330 --> 00:20:23.750
I think I'll buy some more.

00:20:29.160 --> 00:20:30.910
Did you see the new dance?

00:20:30.910 --> 00:20:32.450
Yeah! Yeah!
I watched it the other day!

00:20:32.450 --> 00:20:33.830
It was so awesome.

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:34.410
I know right?

00:20:34.910 --> 00:20:36.750
Oh, hey Ryoko!

00:20:36.750 --> 00:20:38.000
Huh? You're just going home now?

00:20:37.950 --> 00:20:44.410
WEAPON
ENCYCLOPEDIA

00:20:38.000 --> 00:20:40.200
That's a huge book you've got there.

00:20:40.200 --> 00:20:42.450
That looks like a pretty complicated book.

00:20:42.450 --> 00:20:44.250
I just borrowed it from the library.

00:20:44.250 --> 00:20:46.160
See you tomorrow!

00:20:46.160 --> 00:20:47.250
Later.

00:20:57.830 --> 00:20:59.120
Hi-yah!

00:20:59.120 --> 00:21:00.660
Huh? I know that voice.

00:21:00.660 --> 00:21:03.870
Hi-yah! Hi-yah! Hi-yah!

00:21:00.910 --> 00:21:02.540
HI-YAH!

00:21:05.000 --> 00:21:08.000
Ouch, ouch, ouch! Owww, my sides are killing me...

00:21:08.000 --> 00:21:08.700
Hey, Sis.

00:21:08.700 --> 00:21:09.450
Oh!

00:21:09.450 --> 00:21:10.620
Hey, Ryo.

00:21:11.830 --> 00:21:13.450
Crap, my sides...

00:21:14.370 --> 00:21:18.040
Tama Sakura Shopping District

00:21:27.540 --> 00:21:29.950
You caught me doing something
really embarrassing, Ryo.

00:21:29.950 --> 00:21:33.790
You aren't wasting any effort in your quest
to become a great demon, huh, Sis?

00:21:33.790 --> 00:21:36.700
That's right! I'm going to give it my all from here on out!

00:21:37.080 --> 00:21:39.790
You've made your first step on the path
to becoming the leader of the demon horde.

00:21:39.790 --> 00:21:42.120
Hehehe... I'm not so sure about that.

00:21:42.830 --> 00:21:43.950
It's Mom.

00:21:43.950 --> 00:21:45.040
Welcome back.

00:21:45.040 --> 00:21:46.290
Were you spending time together?

00:21:46.290 --> 00:21:48.290
I met up with Sis on my way home.

00:21:48.290 --> 00:21:50.120
Were you out shopping, mom?

00:21:50.120 --> 00:21:52.540
Yes! You wouldn't believe it!

00:21:52.540 --> 00:22:00.040
Brown Mushroom
Enoki
Mushrom

00:21:52.660 --> 00:21:56.450
I got two extra stamps for my lottery card
by buying some mushrooms today!

00:21:56.450 --> 00:21:57.620
That's a big haul!

00:21:57.870 --> 00:22:00.160
Make sure you stick them in the fridge later.

00:22:00.040 --> 00:22:01.660
BANDA TERRACE

00:22:00.160 --> 00:22:01.750
Mushrooms are yummy.

00:22:02.000 --> 00:22:03.580
I'll be sure to season them a bunch.

00:22:03.580 --> 00:22:05.450
Sounds like it will go great with rice.

00:22:05.450 --> 00:22:11.000
This is the tale of a girl
who received demonic powers over night,

00:22:11.000 --> 00:22:15.080
and must rise up to defeat a Magical Girl
in order to save her family from the grips of poverty.

00:22:15.080 --> 00:22:17.410
Or something to that effect.

00:22:22.450 --> 00:22:33.950
The Demon Girl Next Door

00:23:50.950 --> 00:24:02.160
Preview

00:23:51.330 --> 00:23:56.620
I'm Yuko Yoshida! Today I became Shami...
Shadow Mistress Yuko, the Demon Girl.

00:23:56.620 --> 00:23:59.330
But this is where I'm supposed
to talk about the next episode, right?

00:23:59.330 --> 00:24:01.750
Shamiko, let's do some proper warm-ups next time.

00:24:01.750 --> 00:24:03.330
Uwa! The Pink Magical Girl

00:24:02.160 --> 00:24:06.000
Preview
How Sporty Are You?! Everything is Fluctuating

00:24:03.330 --> 00:24:04.370
is headed straight my way again!

00:24:04.370 --> 00:24:06.080
We've got to find a proper weapon for you, too.
